                "name": "hamishwillee",
                "url": "https://github.com/hamishwillee"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11341955?u=4aed4baa1449f2d137eddc1614b6b4493832a9c1&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Clarify that quotes in Content-Disposition's directives are not required in the RFC standard but are encouraged for compatibility.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The current content says the quotes in directives of multipart/form-data's Content-Disposition are required, but it's NOT required in the RFC standard. See the issue linked below for more details.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7578#section-4.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7578#section-4.2</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://httpwg.org/specs/rfc6266.html#n-grammar\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://httpwg.org/specs/rfc6266.html#n-grammar</a></p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3553511197\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41683\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41683/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41683\">#41683</a></p>\n\n\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42065",
            "title": "docs(headers): clarify quotes requirement in Content-Disposition of multipart/form-data",
            "date_modified": "2025-11-23T22:17:24.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-11-23T16:49:10.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "Menci",
                "url": "https://github.com/Menci"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Firefox 146 adds a feature whereby large numbers of unused CSS variables are hidden in the devtools rules view. See <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1719461\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1719461</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I've done some testing and have found that:</p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>The feature is enabled by default in nightly 147 and beta 146, so it isn't hidden behind a pref, and isn't a nightly-only feature.</li>\n<li>The number of unused variables that causes the feature to kick in is 10, so I've reported it as \"10 or more\".</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42063",
            "title": "Firefox 146 hides unused CSS variables in the devtools inspector",
            "date_modified": "2025-11-23T13:47:23.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-11-23T13:45:51.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "chrisdavidmills",
                "url": "https://github.com/chrisdavidmills"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152204036?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Improved the description of the CompressionStream.readable property to make it clearer and more useful for readers. The updated text now explains what the property returns and how it is typically used when working with streams.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The previous summary only described the structure and did not provide practical context. This update helps developers better understand how to use the property when working with streaming compression.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Specification reference:<br>\n<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/CompressionStream\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/CompressionStream</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related MDN page:<br>\n<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/CompressionStream/readable\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/CompressionStream/readable</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #41833.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3598699046\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41833\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41833/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41833\">#41833</a></p>",
