        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #41634.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3541413414\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41634\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41634/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41634\">#41634</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Defines what a valid SanitizerConfig is more precisely and links to this from the places where an invalid config can throw a TypeError.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3547012068\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41649\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41649/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41649\">#41649</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41945",
            "title": "SanitizerConfig - define valid config",
            "date_modified": "2025-11-21T01:01:04.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-11-14T04:47:32.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "hamishwillee",
                "url": "https://github.com/hamishwillee"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40757969?u=16b0d411bf1fd4db6063cecab03cf1e0d813d0b9&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Added an example showing that normal text characters can also be percent-encoded, even if they don't have to.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-js notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"const hex = [];\nhex.length = 256;\nfor (let i = 0; i &lt; 256; i++) {\n  hex[i] = i.toString(16).padStart(2, &quot;0&quot;);\n}\nconsole.log(hex);\nfetch(`data:application/octet-stream;,%${hex.join(&quot;%&quot;)}`)\n  .then((resp) =&gt; resp.arrayBuffer())\n  .then((buf) =&gt; {\n    const bytes = new Uint8Array(buf);\n    console.log([...bytes]);\n    for (let i = 0; i &lt; 256; i++) {\n      if (bytes[i] !== i) {\n        console.log(`buf[${i}] !== ${i}`);\n      }\n    }\n    console.log(&quot;finished&quot;);\n  });\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">hex</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">[</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">]</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s1\">hex</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">length</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">256</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-k\">for</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-k\">let</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">i</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">0</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">i</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">256</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">i</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">++</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-s1\">hex</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">[</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">i</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">]</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">i</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">toString</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">16</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">padStart</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">2</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">,</span> <span class=\"pl-s\">\"0\"</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">console</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">log</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">hex</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-en\">fetch</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s\">`data:application/octet-stream;,%<span class=\"pl-s1\"><span class=\"pl-kos\">${</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">hex</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">join</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s\">\"%\"</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span></span>`</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">then</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">resp</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">resp</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">arrayBuffer</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">then</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">buf</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">bytes</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">new</span> <span class=\"pl-v\">Uint8Array</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">buf</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-smi\">console</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">log</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">[</span>...<span class=\"pl-s1\">bytes</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">]</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-k\">for</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-k\">let</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">i</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">0</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">i</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">256</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">i</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">++</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-k\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">bytes</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">[</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">i</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">]</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">!==</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">i</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"pl-smi\">console</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">log</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s\">`buf[<span class=\"pl-s1\"><span class=\"pl-kos\">${</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">i</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span></span>] !== <span class=\"pl-s1\"><span class=\"pl-kos\">${</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">i</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span></span>`</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-smi\">console</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">log</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s\">\"finished\"</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span></pre></div>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
